<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS5" title="In 6 Model Analysis ‣ Code Like Humans: A Multi-Agent Solution for Medical Coding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.5 </span>Can fine-tuning work as well for LLMs as for BERT?</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S7" title="In Code Like Humans: A Multi-Agent Solution for Medical Coding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7 </span>Discussion</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
