<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S7.SS2" title="In 7 Discussion ‣ Code Like Humans: A Multi-Agent Solution for Medical Coding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7.2 </span>Future work</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
