<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx2.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In Broader Impacts ‣ Code Like Humans: A Multi-Agent Solution for Medical Coding" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Regulation of high-risk AI applications.</span></a></li>
